  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving efficiency of the Adult Vaccination System in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Initiation Plan (PIP) serves as a pilot initiative to provide technical support to MoHFW in strengthening and building a robust and resilient system for TB re-Vaccination in India. UNDP will digitalise all aspects of house-to-house survey for identification of high-risk adults, their registration and vaccination events. Besides, it will generate data for Nikshay portal (online case-based TB surveillance system) of National Tuberculosis Elimination Programme, to follow-up with TB vaccination beneficiaries in India.</narrative>
  </description>
